qimsdk (2.0.0-0clo1~) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial qimsdk source package, superseding gst-plugins-imsdk.
  * Rebrand GStreamer plugin binary packages from imsdk to qimsdk.
  * Add C++ app-builder SDK packages (libqimsdk-app-builder1,
    libqimsdk-app-builder-dev, qimsdk-examples).
  * Add Python bindings (python3-qimsdk) and examples
    (qimsdk-python-examples).
  * Add app-builder pipeline configs (qimsdk-appbuilder-configs).

